@SYSTEM_TITLE

; CSV/ITEM.CSV row 5 is `5,아이템4,124:테스트용`. Emuera reads the price with
; `Int64.TryParse(tokens[2].TrimEnd(), out long price)`
; (GameData/ConstantData.cs:1726-1732), which is strict: the trailing text
; makes the whole field unreadable, so the row is warned about and the price
; is left at 0. The *name* is assigned before that check (`:1722`), so it
; survives the rejected price.
PRINTVL ITEMPRICE:5
PRINTFORML [%ITEMNAME:5%]
